{"type": "header", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid5", "load_s": 1.169, "peak_rss_mb": 510.2, "num_sentences": 30, "decode_params": {"model": "k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx tts-models/kokoro-int8-multi-lang-v1_1.tar.bz2", "model_file": "model.int8.onnx", "lexicons": ["lexicon-us-en.txt", "lexicon-zh.txt"], "rule_fsts": ["date-zh.fst", "phone-zh.fst", "number-zh.fst"], "sid": 5, "speaker": "zf_003", "speed": 1.0, "num_threads": 4}}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid5", "sentence_id": "s001", "text": "你好，今天的会议改到下午3点半开始。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.242, "n_samples": 101819, "proc_s": 5.8572, "rtf": 1.3806, "samples_sha256": "4bf67719fd7e1e940f3a23311816114d89a0f971b66dfe96a5bd2997002ba9a4"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid5", "sentence_id": "s002", "text": "我刚买了一部新的iPhone，用起来很顺手。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 5.058, "n_samples": 121392, "proc_s": 8.2176, "rtf": 1.6247, "samples_sha256": "d0bff82c7b511280e4680211567f0de0ed2ca6c58b8f060b54f731020ffb89c1"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid5", "sentence_id": "s003", "text": "这件衣服打折以后只要128元。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.934, "n_samples": 94415, "proc_s": 6.6129, "rtf": 1.681, "samples_sha256": "a01143fae8fbf2c4a892bc5fdb7594721858eab02df14b4ff0d5848e019fdddd"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid5", "sentence_id": "s004", "text": "我们约在2026年10月20日见面吧。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.822, "n_samples": 91732, "proc_s": 4.6725, "rtf": 1.2225, "samples_sha256": "86dde923fbf4e16972fbc083752b8e0cf35a2ad909218ba43f2ddd39b944438d"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid5", "sentence_id": "s005", "text": "请把报告在周五之前发给我。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.207, "n_samples": 76956, "proc_s": 3.9981, "rtf": 1.2469, "samples_sha256": "689113580ea74db70b7a4197ba15b54d20e3407f40ee9d8b4dee9709766ef667"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid5", "sentence_id": "s006", "text": "现在的AI工具越来越好用了。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.175, "n_samples": 100193, "proc_s": 5.4096, "rtf": 1.2958, "samples_sha256": "62a543532691bcc91f9899056cb7a3802f2c1f0aa554cd5d2d5b2b4809cb882c"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid5", "sentence_id": "s007", "text": "你的航班几点起飞？我记得是早上8点20分。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 5.292, "n_samples": 127013, "proc_s": 6.6141, "rtf": 1.2498, "samples_sha256": "0c11723d2ead98fdc664879c5cfc8b55d032aff827cd88fc2214cd66992bdfe7"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid5", "sentence_id": "s008", "text": "这个月的电费一共是356块钱。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.923, "n_samples": 94156, "proc_s": 4.8595, "rtf": 1.2387, "samples_sha256": "3bc28f478ed18abcb7ec54238019ef69be9051f4fd1337fe8b616f30622cfeee"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid5", "sentence_id": "s009", "text": "我住在3楼，电梯就在门口右边。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.105, "n_samples": 98517, "proc_s": 5.3939, "rtf": 1.314, "samples_sha256": "67ecc9a8564ef19823346028b19ca767163280f07d1dc756873149e2f4b444c1"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid5", "sentence_id": "s010", "text": "他每天跑步5公里，已经坚持了两年。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.252, "n_samples": 102042, "proc_s": 5.1228, "rtf": 1.2049, "samples_sha256": "06c77a7dc66c537963351409a52c919a6b5d77344540b63877f835109fb9febe"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid5", "sentence_id": "s011", "text": "下周一我们要去上海出差。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.9, "n_samples": 69591, "proc_s": 3.6128, "rtf": 1.246, "samples_sha256": "ef90923a20fc33790165ef8bdbd72888f49695883616a832c9f19b4281e8ce99"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid5", "sentence_id": "s012", "text": "你能帮我订一张明天去北京的高铁票吗？", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.039, "n_samples": 96947, "proc_s": 5.0851, "rtf": 1.2588, "samples_sha256": "f34539d5cf84e5052c86c16bdfd209ee7f4449c2a74de652c7275ba1b3918c7f"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid5", "sentence_id": "s013", "text": "这家餐厅的评分是4.8分，值得一试。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.445, "n_samples": 106675, "proc_s": 5.8909, "rtf": 1.3254, "samples_sha256": "19475a9293dd71fa225c70bb6d24a205416a0228f2317c5e0f66c9e10c12ef75"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid5", "sentence_id": "s014", "text": "我的手机号是13812345678，有事打给我。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 5.51, "n_samples": 132241, "proc_s": 7.026, "rtf": 1.2751, "samples_sha256": "0be52241d3b2d3656e776f5f846264954ec222b5b46dee0c44d23160601fabe6"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid5", "sentence_id": "s015", "text": "今年公司的销售额增长了15%。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.457, "n_samples": 82967, "proc_s": 4.1841, "rtf": 1.2103, "samples_sha256": "0b27779253418f2b07c6119288f0596fffcf9d4ba7da3365e6ef2360292c293f"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid5", "sentence_id": "s016", "text": "孩子们放学以后在公园里踢足球。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.502, "n_samples": 84036, "proc_s": 4.246, "rtf": 1.2126, "samples_sha256": "6e2a47cf12e6c993827bae3110f7434ba561115ea7f1c9515ebfe8af37b538e2"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid5", "sentence_id": "s017", "text": "我用微信给你转了2000块，记得查收。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.998, "n_samples": 95961, "proc_s": 5.1842, "rtf": 1.2966, "samples_sha256": "76766df79eb9cdb12acf0172e9fc91574d911cd12242b7444b9018b07052c955"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid5", "sentence_id": "s018", "text": "天气预报说明天最高气温32度。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.779, "n_samples": 90698, "proc_s": 4.6581, "rtf": 1.2326, "samples_sha256": "08fa8f9cc1d4e6fe9e8f665eb6b0b2b8cbb8da02c64456aa202b33bb26ce7b1e"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid5", "sentence_id": "s019", "text": "请问洗手间在哪里？", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.434, "n_samples": 58409, "proc_s": 2.8716, "rtf": 1.1799, "samples_sha256": "e61a954ad71b974a7be075412f758566302491f224da6113a49c791e15f1e72b"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid5", "sentence_id": "s020", "text": "我们的Zoom会议链接已经发到群里了。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.038, "n_samples": 96918, "proc_s": 5.4208, "rtf": 1.3424, "samples_sha256": "70c68720bc6a577e1142b7bcfca130ff3f94908b870fa77fdea786ad080b1991"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid5", "sentence_id": "s021", "text": "这本书我看了一半，故事特别精彩。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.223, "n_samples": 101345, "proc_s": 5.33, "rtf": 1.2622, "samples_sha256": "ef5c039f2b171dc29c667e242f36ccfa22ccc0f18f5f7c9c247780ee3fa8b24c"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid5", "sentence_id": "s022", "text": "他的生日是5月4日，我们准备给他一个惊喜。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 5.006, "n_samples": 120147, "proc_s": 6.5301, "rtf": 1.3044, "samples_sha256": "af4c313f03e311630e0ac5557477c7ac8b6fafb2ea82f568c0de27dbbe3e4ab7"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid5", "sentence_id": "s023", "text": "从这里打车到机场大概需要40分钟。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.24, "n_samples": 101760, "proc_s": 5.1974, "rtf": 1.2258, "samples_sha256": "eca75159975d781f7609bd0515c4111817557f8f7744df819de22f1cc87d22ca"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid5", "sentence_id": "s024", "text": "我刚下载了ChatGPT的新版本。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.198, "n_samples": 100756, "proc_s": 6.0152, "rtf": 1.4328, "samples_sha256": "883576241a7381369b315f61686f96da84746e776562793dbc4e0b7c77e1d216"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid5", "sentence_id": "s025", "text": "房租每个月涨了500元，真让人头疼。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.325, "n_samples": 103799, "proc_s": 5.879, "rtf": 1.3593, "samples_sha256": "2738d093da31468e98d6441165339ac08babae67d9b5cde48b0c2d961ca5e417"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid5", "sentence_id": "s026", "text": "周末你想去看电影还是去爬山？", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 3.535, "n_samples": 84844, "proc_s": 4.4247, "rtf": 1.2516, "samples_sha256": "c5807f4673e273992c5ac5ee14892fad008c64bdacf9f0ed1d442d3f82f439d9"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid5", "sentence_id": "s027", "text": "这台笔记本电脑的价格是6999元。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.579, "n_samples": 109906, "proc_s": 6.0002, "rtf": 1.3102, "samples_sha256": "c627fc433132516d7c773502d678499d6a9c2236f068a8409309ca670f6627dd"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid5", "sentence_id": "s028", "text": "医生建议我每天喝8杯水。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 2.887, "n_samples": 69283, "proc_s": 3.8623, "rtf": 1.3379, "samples_sha256": "c2d346ecd4a18164a438bb9c110ed78582a288aae00e6f2826accd27dd592d37"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid5", "sentence_id": "s029", "text": "我们团队一共有12个人，分成3个小组。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.579, "n_samples": 109897, "proc_s": 6.2361, "rtf": 1.3619, "samples_sha256": "7fe67a0c864f595e2d4bbed9b7718dde094e1459b465e862157f93de8bc03b87"}
{"type": "sentence", "engine": "kokoro-v1_1-int8-zh-sid5", "sentence_id": "s030", "text": "谢谢你的帮忙，下次我请你喝咖啡。", "n_words": 1, "audio_s": 4.002, "n_samples": 96051, "proc_s": 5.3534, "rtf": 1.3376, "samples_sha256": "a1ddf4a1a6dbe79ec8732d3fa0e5f223b72e525ac8bb4d078f5eb3c4a80e0d44"}
